        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>You&#x2019;re reading the web edition of D.C. Diagnosis, STAT&#x2019;s twice-weekly newsletter about the politics and policy of health and medicine.&#xa0;<a href=\"https://www.statnews.com/signup/dc/\">Sign up here</a>&#xa0;to receive it in your inbox on Tuesdays and Thursdays.</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">RFK Jr. paid tribute to the late actor and former evangelist Marjoe Gortner in New Mexico, where the health secretary was <a href=\"https://x.com/RobertKennedyJr/status/2120535307292696896\">photographed</a> with country musician Lyle Lovett, who <a href=\"https://www.dailymail.com/news/article-2714170/Robert-Kennedy-Jr-Cheryl-Hines-tying-knot-300-guest-wedding-extravaganza-surprise-musical-performances-Lyle-Lovett-Natasha-Bedingfield.html\">performed</a> at Kennedy&#x2019;s third wedding. Send news tips and songs about complicated relationships to <a href=\"mailto:John.Wilkerson@statnews.com\">John.Wilkerson@statnews.com</a> or John_Wilkerson.07 on Signal.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-the-curious-overton-situation\"><strong>The curious Overton situation</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A Senate committee chair typically holds a vote on a presidential nomination when the chair knows there are enough yes votes for confirmation. At least that&#x2019;s the case when the White House and the Senate are controlled by the same party.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/12/will-heidi-overton-be-confirmed-fda-commissioner-dc-diagnosis/?utm_campaign=rss\">Continue to STAT+ to read the full story&hellip;</a></p>"
      }
